  "body": "Freehold Title | No Body Corporate Fees\r\n\r\nDiscover this modern 3-bedroom terrace house at 5B Glennandrew Drive, Half Moon Bay. Built in 2022, this well-maintained property offers a comfortable lifestyle without the burden of body corporate fees.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Prime Location: Situated within the prestigious Macleans College zone, ensuring top-quality education for your children. Also, within walking distance to Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College – all just a 15-minute walk or less.\r\n• Freehold Title & No Body Corporate Fees: Enjoy complete ownership and no ongoing body corporate charges.\r\n• Family-Friendly Environment: Fronting Glennandrew Park, this home enjoys uninterrupted green views and a truly open outlook, providing ample outdoor space for recreation and relaxation.\r\n• Convenient Parking: Includes one dedicated parking space, with additional on-street parking readily available for guests.\r\n• Proximity to Amenities: A short drive to Half Moon Bay Marina, offering a variety of dining, shopping, and ferry services. Highland Park Shopping Centre is also nearby, catering to all your retail needs.\r\n• Recreational Opportunities: Close to Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach, perfect for weekend outings and water activities.\r\n• Modern Living: The property is just three years old and comes with a remaining seven-year building warranty, ensuring peace of mind for the new owners.\r\n\r\nThis home is perfect for a family of three looking to settle in a vibrant community with excellent amenities. Don’t miss this opportunity to own an affordable property in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to schedule a viewing, please contact us.",
